Most AI-generated frontends are competent and forgettable — correct, safe, instantly anonymous. Your default assumption should be that this is one of those. Use the full 0.0–1.0 range. A high score requires work that would genuinely surprise a professional designer, not just the absence of obvious mistakes. If your rationale for a score would apply equally well to any competent-but-generic page in this category, the score is too high.

